{"mode":"words","text":"Tästä eteenpäin oppimistavoitteesi määrää suunnan. Jos haluat vain ymmärtää kieltä, olet jo saavuttanut tavoitteesi — jatka vain vaiheisiin kaksi ja kolme. Jos haluat puhua, siirry kuoropuheen harjoitteluun: valitse A-B-toistolla lyhyt lause, aseta nopeus hyvin hitaaksi ja puhu samanaikaisesti ääneen — kuin kuorossa. Kuulet heti, jos jokin kuulostaa erilaiselta, ja korjaat virheet aivan itsestään. Tämä onnistuu missä tahansa, jopa raitiovaunussa: kuulokkeiden avulla se kuulostaa puhelinkeskustelulta. Ja jos haluat oppia kirjoittamaan, kirjoita teksti yksinkertaisesti lause lauseelta mukana.","words":[{"s":0,"e":406},{"s":476,"e":987},{"s":1068,"e":2206},{"s":2276,"e":2670},{"s":2728,"e":3320},{"s":3646,"e":3831},{"s":3901,"e":4261},{"s":4319,"e":4493},{"s":4551,"e":5062},{"s":5132,"e":5724},{"s":5875,"e":6084},{"s":6142,"e":6200},{"s":6246,"e":6827},{"s":6861,"e":7581},{"s":7663,"e":7709},{"s":7825,"e":8173},{"s":8231,"e":8440},{"s":8499,"e":9009},{"s":9056,"e":9450},{"s":9485,"e":9555},{"s":9624,"e":10158},{"s":10483,"e":10646},{"s":10704,"e":11017},{"s":11087,"e":11551},{"s":11598,"e":11935},{"s":11993,"e":12631},{"s":12701,"e":13653},{"s":13862,"e":14268},{"s":14349,"e":15267},{"s":15313,"e":15685},{"s":15766,"e":16323},{"s":16439,"e":16788},{"s":16857,"e":17194},{"s":17252,"e":17519},{"s":17577,"e":18181},{"s":18425,"e":18529},{"s":18587,"e":18831},{"s":18901,"e":19922},{"s":20004,"e":20468},{"s":20491,"e":20538},{"s":20607,"e":20839},{"s":20909,"e":21710},{"s":22221,"e":22593},{"s":22651,"e":23022},{"s":23057,"e":23196},{"s":23254,"e":23533},{"s":23591,"e":24055},{"s":24125,"e":25031},{"s":25100,"e":25193},{"s":25263,"e":25692},{"s":25762,"e":26203},{"s":26273,"e":26540},{"s":26621,"e":27399},{"s":27643,"e":27980},{"s":28038,"e":28491},{"s":28549,"e":28769},{"s":28827,"e":29292},{"s":29361,"e":29628},{"s":29687,"e":30720},{"s":30929,"e":31533},{"s":31602,"e":31950},{"s":31997,"e":32090},{"s":32136,"e":32612},{"s":32670,"e":34063},{"s":34